      "english": "The Green Candy"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "爷爷手里拿着两个糖果，一个绿色的，一个红色的，问小明：“你想要哪一个呢？”",
      "traditional": "爺爺手裡拿著兩個糖果，一個綠色的，一個紅色的，問小明：“你想要哪一個呢？”",
      "pinyin": "yé ye shǒu lǐ ná zhe liǎng ge táng guǒ yí ge lǜ sè de yí ge hóng sè de wèn xiǎo míng nǐ xiǎng yào nǎ yí ge ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Grandpa had two candies in his hand: one green, and one red. He asked Little Ming, “Which one do you want?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明想了一会儿，拿了那个绿色的糖果。",
      "traditional": "小明想了一會兒，拿了那個綠色的糖果。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng xiǎng le yí huì'r ná le nà ge lǜ sè de táng guǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming thought about it for a while, then took the green candy."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "爷爷觉得很奇怪，问他：",
      "traditional": "爺爺覺得很奇怪，問他：",
      "pinyin": "yé ye jué de hěn qí guài wèn tā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "“为什么你要绿色的糖果呢？爷爷觉得红色的比绿色的漂亮呀！”",
      "traditional": "“為什麼你要綠色的糖果呢？爺爺覺得紅色的比綠色的漂亮呀！”",
      "pinyin": "wèi shén me nǐ yào lǜ sè de táng guǒ ne yé ye jué de hóng sè de bǐ lǜ sè de piào liang ya",
      "english": "Grandpa thought this was very strange and asked him, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ".. “Why did you pick the green candy? Grandpa thinks that the red one is prettier than the green one!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小明说：“我要绿色！因为妈妈说，绿色是希望的颜色。”",
      "traditional": "小明說：“我要綠色！因為媽媽說，綠色是希望的顏色。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng shuō wǒ yào lǜ sè yīn wèi mā ma shuō lǜ sè shì xī wàng de yán sè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n     ",
      "traditional": "\n     ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming said, “I want the green one! Because Mom says that green is the color of hope.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "爷爷笑了，说：“很好！那你的希望是什么呢？”",
      "traditional": "爺爺笑了，說：“很好！那你的希望是什麼呢？”",
      "pinyin": "yé ye xiào le shuō hěn hǎo nà nǐ de xī wàng shì shén me ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Grandpa smiled and said, “Very good! Then what is it that you hope for?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "小明也笑了，说：“我希望爷爷把红色的那个糖果也给我。”",
      "traditional": "小明也笑了，說：“我希望爺爺把紅色的那個糖果也給我。”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng yě xiào le shuō wǒ xī wàng yé ye bǎ hóng sè de nà ge táng guǒ yě gěi wǒ",
      "english": ""
    }
