    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Green Candy",
      "",
      "Grandpa had two candies in his hand: one green, and one red. He asked Little Ming, “Which one do you want?”",
      "",
      "Little Ming thought about it for a while, then took the green candy.",
      "",
      "Grandpa thought this was very strange and asked him, ..",
      ".. “Why did you pick the green candy? Grandpa thinks that the red one is prettier than the green one!”",
      "",
      "Little Ming said, “I want the green one! Because Mom says that green is the color of hope.”",
      "",
      "Grandpa smiled and said, “Very good! Then what is it that you hope for?”",
      "",
      "Little Ming also smiled and said, “I hope that Grandpa will also give the red candy to me.”"
    ]
  }
